  "title": "LIST Landslide Planning Map Hazard Bands",
  "description": "LIST Landslide Planning Map Hazard Bands: LIST product `LIST_LANDSLIDE_PLANNING_MAP_HAZARD_BANDS`, statewide. 1,387,572 features, multi-polygon (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `LIST_GUID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2021-01-19. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LIST Landslide Planning Map Hazard Bands\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
